<w:p><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/></w:rPr><w:t>Project structure notes</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>• src/data/equipment.js contains local catalog data and derives product categories.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>• src/components contains Header, Footer, CatalogPage, ProductCard, ProductModal, and CartPage.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>• src/App.jsx owns cart and wishlist state, persistence, and route composition.</w:t></w:r></w:p>
<w:p><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/></w:rPr><w:t>References</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>React documentation: https://react.dev/</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Vite documentation: https://vite.dev/</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>React Router documentation: https://reactrouter.com/</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>React Toastify documentation: https://fkhadra.github.io/react-toastify/</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Lucide icon library: https://lucide.dev/</w:t></w:r></w:p>
<w:p><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/></w:rPr><w:t>Additional notes</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>All products are local mock data. The checkout button is visual only; no payment processing or backend service is connected. The FORGE10 code demonstrates controlled form handling and is intentionally not applied to the displayed order total.</w:t></w:r></w:p>
